      ],
      "source": "https://www.wvencyclopedia.org/entries/489",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "During World War I, the Charleston Ordnance Center, a naval munitions factory, was built in South Charleston to produce gun barrels.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
